<section class="next"><h2>Continue the investigation</h2><p>Compare these critical approaches with the <a href="/en/exegesis/">English close-reading essays</a>, the <a href="/en/themes/">six thematic reading paths</a> and the <a href="/en/archive/">historical archive</a>. The <a href="/leer/" lang="es">full original Spanish poem</a> remains the primary text.</p></section></article>
